# A blueprint whose guests give back an event: the event borrows what the blueprint
# captured, so a widget that gives back what its guests give back is prompt in the
# blueprint and must mark it `prompt` (claude/promptness-checker.md: a blueprint matters
# only through the events its output holds; Jimmy, 15 November). Unchecked, a caller
# would trust the bare signature and a same-tick loop through it would go unseen
# (soundness). Expected text derived by hand.
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*

@Run: fn $@(@!Nat emit Ui.*) -> @$!Nat emit Ui.*
fn @Run $@!b:
    $!out <- rebuild $@!b:
        _
    @ $!out
